# 📊 Workflow

```
Website
   │
   ▼
Requests Library
   │
   ▼
HTML Source
   │
   ▼
BeautifulSoup Parser
   │
   ▼
Extract Required Data
   │
   ▼
Clean Data
   │
   ▼
Pandas DataFrame
   │
   ▼
CSV / Excel / JSON
```

