# 🎯 Learning Outcomes

After completing this project, you will be able to:

- Understand the fundamentals of web scraping
- Send HTTP requests using the Requests library
- Parse HTML using BeautifulSoup
- Extract text, links, images, and tables
- Clean scraped data with Pandas
- Export data into CSV, Excel, and JSON formats
- Build real-world web scraping projects

